@startuml coupon-claim-activity
title 用户浏览并领取优惠券

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
  DiamondBorderColor #3B82F6
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #EF4444
  ArrowColor #475569
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  TitleBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
}

|用户|

start

:浏览公开券中心;

:查看模板详情;

:发起领取;

|优惠券服务|

:领取校验;

if (校验通过?) then (否)
  :返回失败;
  stop
else (是)
endif

:发放落库;

:提交事务;

|数据库|

:写入用户券与状态流水;

|用户|

:领取成功;

stop

@enduml
